WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.900
The Forest Adventure. One sound card, up close.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.500
Play: the forest rises softly, never all at once.

3
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.800
One tap, one step: the volume glides up to 100 in two seconds.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.200
The small dot is the living ambiance: it breathes a little, on its own.

5
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.800
And back down, just as gently.

6
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.400
Pause: the sound fades out. Nothing is ever cut.

7
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:33.200
Play again: it comes back where it was.

8
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.400
Music wears gold. Its loop button: forever, play after, once.

9
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:47.600
Played once, its bar runs from green to red, with the time left.

10
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.600
Events wear red. Once, twice, forever, or random.

11
00:00:54.900 --> 00:01:05.200
Random: the raven calls, waits a pause of its own choosing, and calls again.

12
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:12.800
Now the whole table: music, ambiances and events, each in its row.

13
00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:18.200
An owl, far away.

14
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:24.100
Wind in the leaves, under the birds.

15
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:28.200
A new chapter: the whole forest fades out together.

16
00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:39.600
The calm before the storm. The wind turns restless.

17
00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:49.600
The bear roars, then growls.

18
00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:55.200
Stop all: the scene fades out in four seconds.
